1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,087
This tutorial ends a tenancy contract
before its term is

2
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:08,174
over: terminate it, settle the deposit,
and pay the refund.

3
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:12,670
Ahmed Hassan's contract for unit A-101
runs to the end of

4
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:16,757
December, but he moved out on the
thirty-first of August.

5
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:18,392
First, his July cheque.

6
00:00:18,392 --> 00:00:22,888
It is already at the bank, and the bank
has confirmed

7
00:00:22,888 --> 00:00:27,384
it, so find it in the cheque register and
choose Clear.

8
00:00:27,384 --> 00:00:31,062
Open his contract, and under More actions,
select Terminate.

9
00:00:31,062 --> 00:00:34,741
Set the termination date to the
thirty-first of August.

10
00:00:34,741 --> 00:00:38,828
Rent earned to that day is 56,589.04, and
the 28,410.96

11
00:00:38,828 --> 00:00:42,506
after it is reversed, because it was never
earned.

12
00:00:42,506 --> 00:00:45,367
The October cheque is dated after he

13
00:00:45,367 --> 00:00:48,228
left, so it is returned to him.

14
00:00:48,228 --> 00:00:49,455
Terminate, and confirm.

15
00:00:49,455 --> 00:00:52,316
The settlement opens, computed from the
ledger.

16
00:00:52,316 --> 00:00:55,585
Ahmed's deposit of 22,000 is held, and the

17
00:00:55,585 --> 00:00:58,446
balance shows the landlord owes him
7,160.96.

18
00:00:58,446 --> 00:01:01,307
Deduct 750 for cleaning after move-out,
and

19
00:01:01,307 --> 00:01:03,760
the refund to Ahmed is 28,410.96.

20
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,803
Save the draft, then Finalize.

21
00:01:05,803 --> 00:01:09,073
Finalizing writes the settlement journal,
and the refund

22
00:01:09,073 --> 00:01:12,343
is owed to him until it is paid.

23
00:01:12,343 --> 00:01:13,569
Choose Pay refund.

24
00:01:13,569 --> 00:01:17,247
A payment voucher opens, filled in from
the settlement:

25
00:01:17,247 --> 00:01:20,517
Ahmed, the refunds payable account, and
the amount.

26
00:01:20,517 --> 00:01:25,013
Pay from the building's bank account, the
Emirates Islamic account for

27
00:01:25,013 --> 00:01:29,509
Residence Tower, by bank transfer, enter
the transfer reference, and Post.

28
00:01:29,509 --> 00:01:32,778
Back on Ahmed's settlement, the refund of
28,410.96

29
00:01:32,778 --> 00:01:36,048
is paid in full, and nothing is
outstanding.
